---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="WhoseTurn — the household chore tracker that settles the argument. Track chores, earn points, see who's actually pulling their weight." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFE500" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <title>WhoseTurn — Whose turn is it anyway?</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-badge">HOUSEHOLD ACCOUNTABILITY APP</div>
        <h1>WHOSETURN</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">Whose turn is it anyway?</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          Stop arguing about who does more around the house.<br />
          Start keeping score.
        </p>
        <a href="https://whoseturn.vercel.app/auth" class="btn btn-black">GET STARTED</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROBLEM -->
    <section class="section bg-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>THE PROBLEM</h2>
        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="card card-pink">
            <div class="card-icon">🧠</div>
            <h3>SELECTIVE MEMORY</h3>
            <p>Everyone remembers the chores <strong>they</strong> did. Nobody remembers the ones they didn't.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card-yellow">
            <div class="card-icon">⚖️</div>
            <h3>INVISIBLE LABOUR</h3>
            <p>Half the work in a household goes unnoticed. If it's not tracked, it didn't happen.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card-lime">
            <div class="card-icon">💬</div>
            <h3>THE ARGUMENT</h3>
            <p>"I always do the dishes." "No you don't." Sound familiar? We thought so.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <section class="section bg-yellow">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>HOW IT WORKS</h2>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-lime">1</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>CREATE A GROUP</h3>
              <p>Set up your household and invite your partner, housemates, or whoever you share a bin with.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-pink">2</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>ADD YOUR CHORES</h3>
              <p>List the jobs that need doing and assign point values. Scrubbing the oven? That's worth more than wiping a counter.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-blue">3</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>DO THE THING</h3>
              <p>Finished a chore? Mark it done, earn your points. The leaderboard updates in real time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-number bg-orange">4</div>
            <div class="step-content">
              <h3>LET THE SCORES TALK</h3>
              <p>No more "I think I do more." The numbers are right there. Cold, hard, domestic receipts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURES -->
    <section class="section bg-white">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>FEATURES</h2>
        <div class="card-grid four">
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-lime">✓</div>
            <h3>REAL-TIME SCORES</h3>
            <p>Points update instantly. No refresh needed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-yellow">📋</div>
            <h3>ACTIVITY LOG</h3>
            <p>Full history of who did what and when. Receipts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-pink">🏆</div>
            <h3>LEADERBOARD</h3>
            <p>See who's on top. Friendly competition encouraged.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-blue">🔄</div>
            <h3>RECURRING & ONE-TIME</h3>
            <p>Set chores as recurring or one-off. They disappear when done.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-orange">👥</div>
            <h3>GROUPS</h3>
            <p>Invite anyone with a code. Works for couples, flatshares, families.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <div class="feature-icon bg-lime">📱</div>
            <h3>MOBILE FIRST</h3>
            <p>Designed for your phone. Add to home screen for the full experience.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="section bg-black">
      <div class="container cta">
        <h2 class="text-white">READY TO SETTLE IT?</h2>
        <p class="text-white-muted">Free. No ads. Just accountability.</p>
        <a href="https://whoseturn.vercel.app/auth" class="btn btn-yellow">START TRACKING</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="container footer-inner">
        <span class="footer-brand">WHOSETURN</span>
        <span class="footer-copy">Made with spite and good intentions.</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* ================================
     RESET & BASE
     ================================ */
  *, *::before, *::after {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #000000;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  /* ================================
     COLORS
     ================================ */
  .bg-yellow { background: #FFE500; }
  .bg-lime { background: #BFFF00; }
  .bg-pink { background: #FF2D9B; color: #FFFFFF; }
  .bg-blue { background: #0066FF; color: #FFFFFF; }
  .bg-orange { background: #FF6B00; color: #FFFFFF; }
  .bg-black { background: #000000; }
  .bg-white { background: #FFFFFF; }
  .text-white { color: #FFFFFF; }
  .text-white-muted { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 0.875rem; }

  /* ================================
     LAYOUT
     ================================ */
  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* ================================
     HERO
     ================================ */
  .hero {
    background: #FFE500;
    border-bottom: 4px solid #000;
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    background: #000;
    color: #FFE500;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 2px solid #000;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.7;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  /* ================================
     BUTTONS
     ================================ */
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
    border: 3px solid #000;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 0 #000;
    transition: all 0.1s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 0 #000;
    transform: translate(3px, 3px);
  }

  .btn:active {
    box-shadow: none;
    transform: translate(6px, 6px);
  }

  .btn-black {
    background: #000;
    color: #FFE500;
  }

  .btn-yellow {
    background: #FFE500;
    color: #000;
  }

  /* ================================
     CARDS
     ================================ */
  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-grid.four {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  }

  .card {
    border: 3px solid #000;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 0 #000;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-pink { background: #FF2D9B; color: #FFF; }
  .card-yellow { background: #FFE500; }
  .card-lime { background: #BFFF00; }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* ================================
     STEPS
     ================================ */
  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #FFF;
    border: 3px solid #000;
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 0 #000;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-number {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    min-width: 48px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 3px solid #000;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .step-content p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* ================================
     FEATURES
     ================================ */
  .feature {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 3px solid #000;
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 0 #000;
    background: #FFF;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    border: 2px solid #000;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature h3 {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .feature p {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* ================================
     CTA
     ================================ */
  .cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta p {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* ================================
     FOOTER
     ================================ */
  .footer {
    background: #000;
    border-top: 4px solid #FFE500;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFE500;
  }

  .footer-copy {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }

  /* ================================
     RESPONSIVE
     ================================ */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .section {
      padding: 3rem 0;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
    }

    .card-grid, .card-grid.four {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
